  "page_title": "Azure OpenAI Service model versions",
  "page_description": "Learn about model versions in Azure OpenAI.",
  "page_date": "10/30/2023",
  "chunk_title": "What you need to know about Azure OpenAI model version upgrades",
  "chunk_content": "What you need to know about Azure OpenAI model version upgrades  As a customer of Azure OpenAI models, you might notice some changes in the model behavior and compatibility after a version upgrade.  These changes might affect your applications and workflows that rely on the models.  Here are some tips to help you prepare for version upgrades and minimize the impact:  * Read what’s new and models to understand the changes and new features. * Read the documentation on model deployments and version upgrades to understand how to work with model versions. * Test your applications and workflows with the new model version after release. * Update your code and configuration to use the new features and capabilities of the new model version.",
